From: kopebax <kopebax@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:42:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] nx591j: defconfig: disable eMMC CMDQ
 (mmc_blk_cmdq_issue_rq BUG under heavy I/O)

---
 arch/arm64/configs/lineageos_nx591j_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/lineageos_nx591j_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/lineageos_nx591j_defconfig
index a2cf5d57..b13b8ecb 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/lineageos_nx591j_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/lineageos_nx591j_defconfig
@@ -432,7 +432,7 @@ CONFIG_MMC_BLOCK_MINORS=32
 CONFIG_MMC_SDHCI=y
 CONFIG_MMC_SDHCI_PLTFM=y
 CONFIG_MMC_SDHCI_MSM=y
-CONFIG_MMC_CQ_HCI=y
+# CONFIG_MMC_CQ_HCI is not set
 CONFIG_LEDS_TRIGGERS=y
 CONFIG_SWITCH=y
 CONFIG_EDAC=y
